    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join our Discord!</h1><p>",
    "about_the_game": "It's a bird! It's a plan! It's a garbage can?<br><br>Face your friends in this ridiculous cat-and-mouse free-to-play shooter.<br><br><strong>Props</strong><br>Try to blend in with the environment by turning into an object in the level. Taunt your opponents to gain score, blow yourself up to enact revenge, and flash them to run away in a pinch!<br><br><strong>Hunters</strong><br>Search the map for other players disguised as props. Use your killer instincts to sniff them out, and if that fails... you can always launch a train.<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Satisfying gunplay<br></li><li> Private/Public lobbies<br></li><li> Character customization<br></li><li> Over 15 Guns/Abilities<br></li><li> Runs on most computers!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "It's a bird! It's a plan! It's a garbage can? Face your friends in this ridiculous cat-and-mouse free-to-play shooter. Become a prop and hide within your environment, or become a hunter. Use guns, abilities, and occasionally trains to win the game!",
